<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Manufacturing Quality Dashboard</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/Chart.js/4.4.1/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#05070d; --panel:#0d1220; --panel2:#131a2c; --border:#212a40;
  --blue:#2f6fed; --blue2:#5b9bff; --blueDim:#1a3a7a;
  --good:#22c55e; --warn:#eab308; --bad:#ef4444;
  --text:#e7eaf3; --muted:#8792ab; --white:#fff;
  --head:'Poppins','Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif; --body:'Inter','Noto Sans Thai',sans-serif; --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:var(--body);padding:20px;min-height:100vh}
.wrap{max-width:1500px;margin:0 auto}
header{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.logo-word{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:800;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--white);line-height:1}
.logo-word span{color:var(--blue2)}
.logo-sub{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.title{text-align:right}
.title h1{font-family:var(--head);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--white)}
.title div{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
.filters{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.filters .lbl{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin-right:4px}
select,input[type=date]{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:12px;font-family:var(--body);outline:none;color-scheme:dark;max-width:200px}
select:focus,input:focus{border-color:var(--blue)}
.btn{background:var(--blueDim);color:var(--blue2);border:1px solid var(--blue);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 12px;font-size:12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--body)}
.grid{display:grid;gap:14px;margin-bottom:18px}
.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr)}
.kpi{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-top:2px solid var(--blue);border-radius:12px;padding:14px}
.kpi .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--muted)}
.kpi .v{font-family:var(--head);font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:var(--white);margin-top:6px;line-height:1}
.kpi .v small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;margin-left:4px}
.panel{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:16px;min-width:0}
.ph{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
.ph i{width:3px;height:14px;background:var(--blue2);border-radius:2px;display:block}
.ph h3{font-family:var(--head);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase}
.badge{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;background:var(--blueDim);color:var(--blue2);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:600}
.gauges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-around;gap:20px;padding:6px 0}
.gauge{text-align:center}
.gauge .n{font-family:var(--head);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;margin-top:4px}
.gauge .s{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.row2{grid-template-columns:2fr 3fr}
.row3{grid-template-columns:3fr 2fr}
.donuts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.chartbox{position:relative;height:300px}
.chartbox.sm{height:170px}
.legend{margin-top:8px;font-size:11px}
.legend div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted)}
.legend b{font-family:var(--mono);color:var(--text);font-weight:500}
.dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:4px;margin-right:6px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px}
th{color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;text-align:left;padding:7px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
td{padding:7px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.r{text-align:right}
th.r{text-align:right}
.scroll{max-height:420px;overflow:auto}
.scroll thead th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--panel)}
tr.click{cursor:pointer}
tr.click:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
tr.sel{background:var(--panel2)}
.heat{overflow-x:auto}
.heat table{font-size:10px;width:auto}
.heat th.v{writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg);height:100px;font-weight:400;padding:2px;border:none}
.heat td{text-align:center;width:36px;height:32px;border:1px solid var(--bg)}
.note{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:1100px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.row2,.row3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:600px){.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.title{text-align:left}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <!-- เปลี่ยนเป็นโลโก้บริษัทได้: แทนที่ <svg> ด้วย <img src="logo.png" height="64"> -->
    <svg width="64" height="64" viewBox="0 0 52 52" fill="none">
      <defs><linearGradient id="lg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#5b9bff"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#2f6fed"/></linearGradient></defs>
      <polygon points="26,2 47,14 47,38 26,50 5,38 5,14" fill="url(#lg)" fill-opacity=".18" stroke="url(#lg)" stroke-width="2"/>
      <rect x="15" y="28" width="5" height="12" rx="1.5" fill="#5b9bff"/>
      <rect x="23.5" y="20" width="5" height="20" rx="1.5" fill="#fff"/>
      <rect x="32" y="14" width="5" height="26" rx="1.5" fill="#5b9bff"/>
    </svg>
    <div><div class="logo-word">DOOR<span>LINE</span></div><div class="logo-sub">QUALITY CONTROL</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="title"><h1>MANUFACTURING QUALITY DASHBOARD</h1><div id="range"></div></div>
</header>

<div class="filters">
  <span class="lbl">Filters</span>
  <select id="fLine"></select>
  <select id="fShift"></select>
  <select id="fModel"></select>
  <select id="fDefect"></select>
  <select id="fGran">
    <option value="day">Daily view</option>
    <option value="week" selected>Weekly view</option>
    <option value="month">Monthly view</option>
  </select>
  <select id="fMonth"></select>
  <input type="date" id="fStart"><span style="color:var(--muted);font-size:11px">to</span><input type="date" id="fEnd">
  <button class="btn" id="reset">Reset</button>
</div>

<div class="grid kpis" id="kpis"></div>

<div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
  <div class="ph"><i></i><h3>First Time Right by Door</h3><span class="badge" id="targetBadge"></span></div>
  <div class="gauges" id="gauges"></div>
</div>

<div class="grid row2">
  <div class="donuts">
    <div class="panel"><div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Production Share</h3></div><div class="chartbox sm"><canvas id="cProdShare"></canvas></div><div class="legend" id="lgProd"></div></div>
    <div class="panel"><div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Defect Share</h3></div><div class="chartbox sm"><canvas id="cDefShare"></canvas></div><div class="legend" id="lgDef"></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel"><div class="ph"><i></i><h3 id="tFtr">FTR Trend by Door</h3></div><div class="chartbox"><canvas id="cFtr"></canvas></div></div>
</div>

<div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
  <div class="ph"><i></i><h3 id="tProd">Production &amp; Defect Trend</h3></div>
  <div class="chartbox" style="height:260px"><canvas id="cProd"></canvas></div>
</div>

<div class="grid row3">
  <div class="panel"><div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Top 10 Defects — Pareto</h3><span class="badge">80/20</span></div><div class="chartbox"><canvas id="cPareto"></canvas></div></div>
  <div class="panel"><div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Top 5 Defects</h3></div>
    <table><thead><tr><th>Defect</th><th class="r">Qty</th><th class="r">%</th><th class="r">Cum%</th></tr></thead><tbody id="top5"></tbody></table>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
  <div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Heatmap — Door × Defect (Top 10)</h3></div>
  <div class="heat" id="heat"></div>
</div>

<div class="panel">
  <div class="ph"><i></i><h3>Breakdown by Model / Part</h3><span class="badge" id="modelBadge"></span></div>
  <div class="scroll"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Model</th><th>Door</th><th class="r">Production</th><th class="r">Defect</th><th class="r">FTR %</th><th class="r">Defect Rate %</th><th>Top Defect</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="models"></tbody>
  </table></div>
  <div style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">คลิกที่แถวเพื่อกรองทั้ง Dashboard ตาม Model นั้น</div>
</div>

<div class="note">
  แหล่งข้อมูล: FTR_Aug_2026.xlsx (ชีต DATA) · สูตร: Defect Rate % = Total Defect ÷ Total Production × 100 · FTR % = 100 − Defect Rate % ·
  คำนวณจากยอดรวมจริงเสมอ ไม่นำเปอร์เซ็นต์ของแต่ละรุ่นมาเฉลี่ยหรือบวกกัน · สัดส่วน (Share / Pareto) มีฐานรวม 100% ·
  แถวที่มีของเสียแต่ไม่ระบุประเภทจัดเป็น "อื่นๆ (ไม่ระบุประเภท)"
</div>
</div>

